#17000
The Mines Of Moria (Depths).~
   This is the expansion to the standard diku area of moria. It is very loosely 
based on the actual Mines of Moria from J.R.R. Tolkien's Lord of the Rings,
and is meant for characters of level 15-30. Written by Sauron for Raven DikuMud.
~
170 12 0 0 0 0 255 0
D3
To the west is the 4th level of the Mines of Moria.
~
~
0 0 17001
S
#17001
The Hole.~
   Deeper into the depths of the mountains you go. There is an iron door to the
north, the first signs of civilized life you have seen in these monster ridden
tunnels. Above you there is a hole taking you towards the surface and freedom
from the claustrophobia that is slowly overwhelming you.
~
