#17002
Approaching the Dwarven Sanctuary.~
   The tunnel here is much smoother than those you have seen elsewhere in the
mines. There are elaborate lines carved in the rock near the ceiling, you
suspect that they are of Dwarven origin, although you haven't seen any sign of
dwarves living amidst the monsters that seem to be everywhere.
   To the north an iron door blocks any further progress while to the south
there is a hole in the ceiling leading to the level above.
~
