#17003
Before the Iron Door.~
   Before you stands a sturdy iron door. It has some scratches and dents upon 
its surface as though something has tried to knock it down, but whatever it was
seems to have failed its attempt to penetrate the defenses.
   There is a small guardhouse off to the east and a corridor leading off to
the south. The door bars any further progress northwards.
~
