this was some sort of library or records storage room at some stage. Now all
the books have withered and all that remains on the shelves is dust. Despite
this the room is now filled with activity as it has become the council chamber
of the current Lord.
   The chamber continues to the north and west, while to the east is a door
and the only exit to the Chamber.
~
