#17040
The Shaman's Chamber.~
   This chamber is the only part of this lair that is lit. Perhaps this is why
the rest of the Orogs avoid it, or perhaps they avoid this area in awe and fear
of the magical power of their witch-doctor. Regardless, this room is full of
various jars and pots containing all manner of awful ingredients for the
shaman's evil spells.
   The only exit is back to the south into the darkness.
~
